<body>
    <h1>Rules =E2=80=94 Template</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-Rules=E2=80=94Template">Rules =E2=
=80=94 Template</h1>
<p>This page is the reusable rules template for the AI Agent Toolkit. Copy =
this page when setting up the toolkit for a new product. Rename the copied =
page to <strong>Project Rules</strong> (or your team's equivalent). Fill in=
 the Product Context, Team &amp; Ownership, and Agent Behaviour Notes secti=
ons. Do not fill in values on this template page.</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-ProductContext">Product Context</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Field</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Value</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Product Name</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[REQUIRED]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Domain</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[REQUIRED =E2=80=94 e.g. FinTech, HealthTech, Supply Chain]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Target Users</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[REQUIRED =E2=80=94 e.g. Enterprise procurement teams]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Tech Stack</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[e.g. React + .NET + PostgreSQL + Azure]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Team Size</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[e.g. 8]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Methodology</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[e.g. Scrum, Kanban, SAFe]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Sprint Duration</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[e.g. 2 weeks]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confluence Space Key</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[REQUIRED =E2=80=94 e.g. HFC]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Confluence Instance</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[e.g. <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"http://yourorg.atlassian.net" r=
el=3D"nofollow">yourorg.atlassian.net</a>]</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-Team&amp;Ownership">Team &amp; Ownership</=
h2>
<p>Agents use these as defaults when the user does not specify owners in a =
session. The user may override per session.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Role</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Name</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Product Owner</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[Name]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default Document Owner</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[Name]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default UI/UX Owner</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[Name or TBC]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Default Approver</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[Name or TBC]</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-AgentBehaviourNotes">Agent Behaviour Notes=
</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p>All Confluence pages must be created in space <strong>[Space Key]</stron=
g> on <strong>[Confluence Instance]</strong></p></li>
<li>
<p>The agent will ask the user for the parent page at publish time =E2=80=
=94 no staging folder needed</p></li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-UniversalPrinciples">Universal Principles<=
/h2>
<h3 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-1.ClarityOverCleverness">1. Clarity Over C=
leverness</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Use simple, direct language in all documents</p></li>
<li>
<p>Avoid jargon unless the audience is technical AND the term is standard i=
n the domain</p></li>
<li>
<p>If something can be misinterpreted, it will be =E2=80=94 write to preven=
t that</p></li>
<li>
<p>Every acronym must be defined on first use</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-2.Traceability">2. Traceability</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Every requirement must trace to a business goal</p></li>
<li>
<p>Every design decision must trace to a requirement</p></li>
<li>
<p>Every piece of code must trace to a user story</p></li>
<li>
<p>Every test must trace to an acceptance criterion</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-3.SecuritybyDefault">3. Security by Defaul=
t</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>Never hardcode secrets, tokens, or credentials</p></li>
<li>
<p>Always validate input at every boundary</p></li>
<li>
<p>Apply principle of least privilege everywhere</p></li>
<li>
<p>Encrypt sensitive data at rest and in transit</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-4.Accessibility">4. Accessibility</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>All user-facing features must meet WCAG 2.1 AA compliance</p></li>
<li>
<p>Semantic HTML is mandatory</p></li>
<li>
<p>Keyboard navigation must work for all interactive elements</p></li>
<li>
<p>Colour must never be the sole means of conveying information</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-5.InternationalisationReadiness">5. Intern=
ationalisation Readiness</h3>
<ul>
<li>
<p>No hardcoded user-facing strings =E2=80=94 use localisation keys</p></li=
>
<li>
<p>Support UTF-8 everywhere</p></li>
<li>
<p>Design date, time, currency, and number formats to be locale-aware</p></=
li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-NamingConventions">Naming Conventions</h2>
<p>Remove rows not applicable to your stack.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Artifact</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Convention</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Example</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PRD (document reference)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PRD-[EpicCode]-vX.X</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PRD-INV-v1.0</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PRD (Confluence page title)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PRD: [Epic Name] vX.X</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PRD: Inventory Management v1.0</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Feature ID</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[EpicCode]-F01, [EpicCode]-F02</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>INV-F01</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User Story (Confluence page title)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[FeatureID] =E2=80=94 [Feature Name]</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>INV-F01 =E2=80=94 Add Stock Item</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>User Story (Jira)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>US-[EpicCode]-[sequence]</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>US-INV-001</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>HLD</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>HLD-[EpicCode]-vX.X</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>HLD-INV-v1.0</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>API Endpoint</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>kebab-case</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>/api/v1/stock-items</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Database Table</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>snake_case (singular)</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>stock_item</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>React Component</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PascalCase</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>StockItemTable.tsx</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Angular Component</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>kebab-case</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>stock-item-table.component.ts</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>.NET Class</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>PascalCase</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>StockItemService.cs</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Node.js Module</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>camelCase</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>stockItemService.js</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Test File</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[source].test.[ext]</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>StockItemTable.test.tsx</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Environment Variable</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>UPPER_SNAKE_CASE</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>DATABASE_CONNECTION_STRING</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-DefinitionofDone">Definition of Done</h2>
<p>A feature is Done when ALL of the following are true:</p>
<ol start=3D"1">
<li>
<p><strong>Code</strong> =E2=80=94 Written, reviewed, and merged to the mai=
n branch</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Tests</strong> =E2=80=94 Unit tests (80% coverage), integration =
tests, and E2E tests pass</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Documentation</strong> =E2=80=94 API docs, inline comments, and =
README updated</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Accessibility</strong> =E2=80=94 Tested with screen reader and k=
eyboard navigation</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Security</strong> =E2=80=94 No secrets in code, input validation=
 in place, OWASP top 10 addressed</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Observability</strong> =E2=80=94 Logging, metrics, and health ch=
ecks implemented</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Review</strong> =E2=80=94 Peer-reviewed by at least one team mem=
ber</p></li>
<li>
<p><strong>Acceptance</strong> =E2=80=94 Product Owner has accepted the fea=
ture against acceptance criteria</p></li>
</ol>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-GitConventions">Git Conventions</h2>
<p>Branch naming:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">feature=
/US-[EpicCode]-[ID]-short-description
bugfix/BUG-[ID]-short-description
hotfix/HOT-[ID]-short-description
release/v[MAJOR].[MINOR].[PATCH]</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Commit messages use Conventional Commits format:</p>
<div class=3D"code panel pdl" style=3D"border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"codeContent panelContent pdl">
<pre class=3D"syntaxhighlighter-pre" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=3D"brush=
: java; gutter: false; theme: Confluence" data-theme=3D"Confluence">type(sc=
ope): short description
[optional body]
[optional footer with ticket reference]</pre>
</div>
</div>
<p>Types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore, perf</p>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-EnvironmentStrategy">Environment Strategy<=
/h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Environment</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Purpose</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Data</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Access</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Local</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Developer machine</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Seeded/mocked</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Developer only</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Dev</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Integration testing</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Synthetic</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Dev team</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>QA</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>QA testing</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Synthetic</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>QA + Dev</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Staging</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Pre-production validation</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Anonymised prod</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Full team</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Production</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Live users</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Real</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Ops + on-call</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<hr>
<h2 id=3D"Rules=E2=80=94Template-Non-FunctionalRequirements(Defaults)">Non-=
Functional Requirements (Defaults)</h2>
<p>Unless a PRD specifies otherwise, apply these defaults to all features:<=
/p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-layout=3D"default" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Category</p></th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p>Default</p></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Response Time</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>API &lt; 200ms (p95), Page Load &lt; 2s (LCP)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Availability</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>99.9% uptime</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Scalability</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Handle 10x current load without architecture changes</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Data Retention</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>[Adjust for your domain =E2=80=94 e.g. 7 years financial, 3 years operat=
ional, 90 days logs]</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Backup</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>Daily automated, 30-day retention</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>RPO / RTO</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p>RPO &lt; 1 hour, RTO &lt; 4 hours</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
